> **📋 RANO CRITERIA**
> **Complete Response**: Disappearance of all enhancing disease
> **Partial Response**: ≥50% decrease in sum of products
> **Stable Disease**: <50% decrease to <25% increase
> **Progressive Disease**: ≥25% increase OR new lesion

